<section class="ah-admin-panel ah-organizations" data-organizations aria-labelledby="organizations-title">
  <div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="organizations-title">参与组织</h2><p>维护组织图片、名称及对方页面。组织预设公开，点击绿色开关可改为未公开；保存后点击「发布到前台」。发布会更新全部已保存内容。</p></div><div class="ah-admin-toolbar-actions"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-publish-button" data-admin-publish>发布到前台</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-organization-add>＋ 新增组织</button></div></div>
  <p class="ah-admin-small" data-organizations-legacy hidden>以下是网站已有的组织名称，尚未加入这份后台草稿。请核对后保存；没有预设图片、网址或参展身份。</p>
  <p class="ah-admin-small">组织参展身份不代表已分配展位，也不增加个人参会人数。具体位置请到展位或现场配置页安排。</p>
  <div class="ah-admin-content-filters"><label for="organization-publication-filter">公开状态<select id="organization-publication-filter" data-organization-publication-filter><option value="">全部公开状态</option><option value="public">公开</option><option value="private">未公开</option><option value="published">前台已发布</option><option value="unpublished">前台未发布</option><option value="ready">可发布</option><option value="changed">变更待发布</option><option value="blocked">已设为未公开</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="ah-organization-list" data-organization-list></div>
  <p class="ah-admin-empty" data-organizations-empty hidden>还没有符合筛选的组织。新增组织预设公开，保存后点击「发布到前台」。</p>
  <dialog class="ah-admin-dialog" data-organization-dialog aria-labelledby="organization-dialog-title">
    <div class="ah-admin-dialog-heading"><h2 id="organization-dialog-title" data-organization-dialog-title>新增组织</h2><button type="button" class="ah-admin-icon-button" data-organization-close aria-label="关闭组织编辑">×</button></div>
    <p class="ah-admin-alert" data-organization-error role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
    <form method="post" data-organization-form>
      <input type="hidden" name="id" /><input type="hidden" name="logoId" /><input type="hidden" name="visibility" value="public" />
      <div class="ah-visibility-control"><span>公开设置</span><button type="button" class="ah-visibility-switch" data-organization-visibility data-visibility="public" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-label="组织公开">公开</button><small>预设公开；手动关闭才不公开。保存后点击「发布到前台」生效。</small></div>
      <div class="ah-organization-image-editor"><div class="ah-organization-image"><img data-organization-preview alt="组织图片内部预览" width="160" height="110" hidden /><span data-organization-image-empty>组织图片</span></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="organization-image">组织图片 / Logo（选填）</label><input id="organization-image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" data-organization-image /><small>原图最多 12 MiB／四千万像素；可裁切、缩放、移动和去背景，确认裁切后才上传。透明背景会保留；最长 800px、最多 512 KiB，自动移除元数据。</small><p class="ah-admin-small" data-organization-image-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="ah-admin-toolbar-actions"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-text-button" data-organization-image-edit>编辑现有图片</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-text-button" data-organization-image-remove>移除本次图片</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-organization-image-retry hidden>重试上传</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-text-button" data-organization-image-discard hidden>取消本次图片</button></div></div></div>
      <div data-organization-image-editor hidden></div>
      <div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="organization-name">组织名称</label><input id="organization-name" name="name" required maxlength="160" autocomplete="off" /></div>
      <div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="organization-website">组织页面链接（选填）</label><input id="organization-website" name="website" type="url" maxlength="500" placeholder="https://" autocomplete="off" /><small>填写对方官网或介绍页面。仅接受不含账号密码的 HTTP／HTTPS 链接。</small></div>
      <div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="organization-participation">参与形式</label><select id="organization-participation" name="participation" required><option value="undecided">待确定</option><option value="exhibitor">参展</option><option value="attendee">一般参与</option></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="organization-status">参加确认</label><select id="organization-status" name="status" required><option value="pending">待确认</option><option value="confirmed">已确认</option><option value="withdrawn">已退出</option></select></div></div>
      <details><summary>授权记录</summary><label class="ah-admin-guest-consent" for="organization-consent"><input id="organization-consent" name="publicConsent" type="checkbox" /><span>已核实组织同意公开这份名称、图片、链接与参与形式。</span></label>
      <p class="ah-admin-small" data-organization-consent-note>授权记录与公开开关分别保存；公开设置变更后，点击「发布到前台」更新网站。</p></details>
      <div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="organization-notes">内部备注 · 不公开</label><textarea id="organization-notes" name="internalNotes" rows="3" maxlength="4000"></textarea></div>
      <div class="ah-admin-dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-organization-close>取消</button><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-content-copy="organization">复制填写内容</button><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-organization-submit>保存</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
</section>
